{
  "id": "1CO.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Abakorinto 11",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobe abegi baane, buna inche inde omwegi o Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abakungu beboetie ase emesangererekano y’ekanisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabatogirie baminto, ekiagera mwang’inyoire ase amang’ana onsi, na inwe mwabwatire chingencho echi nabaete koreng’ana buna nabachiete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nindigetie momanye ng’a Kristo nere omotwe o kera omosacha; na omosacha nere omotwe bw’omokuungu; na Nyasae nere omotwe o Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omosacha kagosaba gose gakobana, na ere nare negento atubete omotwe oye, igo tasigeti omotwe oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende kera omokungu kagosaba gose kobana na taboeti omotwe oye, igo tasigeti omotwe oye, nigo areng’aine nere oyogingerete etukia yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki onye omokungu tarigeti kweboa, tiga agingire etukia yaye; korende onye nobosooku ase omokungu konachwa etukia yaye gose kogingirwa tiga eboe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki tegwenereti omosacha gotuba omotwe oye, ekiagera nomogwekano bw’obonene bwa Nyasae; korende omokungu nobonene bw’omosaacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Naki omosacha tarwete ase omokungu, korende nomokuungu orwete ase omosacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose omosacha tatongetwe ase engencho y’omokuungu, korende nomokuungu ase engencho y’omosaacha.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio negwenerete omokungu abe nekemanyererio gi’okobua ase omotwe oye ase engencho y’abamalaika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Korende ase Omonene omokungu takoba omosacha ataiyo, gose omosacha takoba omokungu ataiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki buna omokungu arwete ase omosacha, naboigo na omosacha nere akoiborwa nomokuungu, korende bionsi nigo bikorua ase Nyasae.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egambie inwe abanyene. Inee! Mboronge omokungu asabe Nyasae atatubeti omotwe oye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Engencho ya Mwanyabaanto teri kworokereria ng’a onye omosacha okoba netukia entambe nigo ere obosooku asare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende onye omokungu okoba netukia entambe nigo ere obonene bwaye? Ekiagera oeirwe etukia eria ase ogwetuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye monto onde bwensi origetie korenta amang’ana ’okoamererania ase engencho eyio, intwe titori nengencho buna eyio, nonya ne chikanisa chia Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogochecheria Epasaka y’Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ase okobaa amachiiko akobwatia ayio tinkobatogia, ekiagera timori gosangererekana ase amaya korende ase ogosaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ritang’ani naigure ng’a ekero mogosangerereka ase ekanisa ogwatananekana nkore ase more. Ayande aya naigure negenire ng’a namaene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ogwatananekana nkogwenerete kobe ase egati yaino, erinde abwo bare abeekeene bamanyekane maiso marore ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero mogosangererekana amo, timori koria endagera y’Omonene;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naki kera oyomo nigo agotang’ana kobogoria endagera yaye ase okoria, oyomo nare nenchara, na oyonde otindete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Timori ne chinyomba aase mokoragerera na konywera? Gose mwachayire ekanisa ya Nyasae na gosookia abwo batari na gento? Naki ndabateebie? Nimbatogie ase aya? Yaya, tinkobatogia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bun’Omonene orokereretie endagera yaye egokorwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 26:26-29; Mar 14:22-25; Luk 22:14-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki inche nkanyora korwa ase Omonene aya nabaeire inwe, ng’a Omonene Yeso obotuko boria aruetwe akabogoria omogati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gakoorire koiraneria ng’a mbuya mono, akayosamunyora, akabora karie, “Oyo noro omobere one orurwe ase engencho yaino; kora iga ase okong’inyora inche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo akabogoria egekombe magega y’okoria, akabora, “Egekombe eke nokobwatana okoyia ase amanyinga aane; kora iga kera ekero mogokenywera ase okong’inyora inche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki kera ekero mokoria omogati oyo na konywera egekombe eke, nigo mokoraria amakweri y’Omonene goika achiche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okonyora endagera y’Omonene buna etagwenereti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki kera oyokoria omogati oyo gose konywera egekombe eke ki’Omonene buna etagwenereti nabe nokomocha igoro y’omobere bw’Omonene na amanyinga aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga omonto erenge omonyene, erio arie omogati na konywera egekombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki oyokoria na konywa buna etagwenereti nigo akwegambia ere omonyene ase okoria na konywa, ase ogotatanana ng’a oria nomobere bw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakio gekogera abange ase more bare abareu na abarwaire, na abanto batari bake bakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende gatoregambie buya intwe abanyene, anga titwagambigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gatokogambigwa iga togosusurwa n’Omonene, titobaisa konacherwa ekiina amo nense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
